@startuml SEQ_10_MENYETUJUI_KEGIATAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-10: Approval Kegiatan (Dosen dan Kadep)

actor       "Dosen / Kadep"         as Approver
boundary    "KegiatanPage"          as Page
control     "KegiatanController"    as Ctrl
entity      "Kegiatan"              as ModelKegiatan

== Lihat Kegiatan Menunggu Approval ==

Approver -> Page          : Buka halaman daftar kegiatan
Page --> Approver : response / redirect
Page  -> Ctrl             : GET /kegiatan
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan    : Query kegiatan menunggu approval
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl    : Data kegiatan
Ctrl  --> Page            : Render daftar kegiatan
Page  --> Approver        : Tampil daftar kegiatan

== Setujui Kegiatan ==

Approver -> Page          : Klik "Setujui"
Page --> Approver : response / redirect
Page  -> Ctrl             : POST /kegiatan/{id}/approve
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan    : Query kegiatan berdasarkan id
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl    : Data kegiatan

alt Approver adalah Dosen
  Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan  : Update status menunggu_persetujuan_kadep
  ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Hasil proses
  Ctrl --> Page           : Redirect sukses (menunggu approval kadep)
else Approver adalah Kadep
  Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan  : Update status disetujui
  ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Hasil proses
  Ctrl --> Page           : Redirect sukses (disetujui)
end

Page  --> Approver        : Tampil notifikasi sukses

== Tolak Kegiatan ==

Approver -> Page          : Klik "Tolak", isi alasan
Page --> Approver : response / redirect
Page  -> Ctrl             : POST /kegiatan/{id}/reject
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan    : Query kegiatan berdasarkan id
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl    : Data kegiatan
Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan    : Update status ditolak + simpan alasan
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Hasil proses
Ctrl  --> Page            : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Page  --> Approver        : Tampil notifikasi sukses, status ditolak

@enduml